{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）資深藝人兼節目主持人劉彩玉今日被爆出離巢消息，隨後她於個人社交平台親自發文回應，正式證實已結束與無綫長達逾35年的賓主關係。劉彩</p><p>無綫（TVB）資深藝人兼節目主持人劉彩玉今日被爆出離巢消息，隨後她於個人社交平台親自發文回應，正式證實已結束與無綫長達逾35年的賓主關係。</p><figure><img alt=\"資深主持劉彩玉發文證離巢。（fb截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194766712994533376816207.png/bxg-Mjn4845BTIofAM5CTfCQOO5FqjJu6bn5nOm5-Zw\"/><figcaption>資深主持劉彩玉發文證離巢。（fb截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>劉彩玉上載了多張近照及與合作夥伴的合照，並感性寫道：「感謝大家還記得我呢位中午時段節目主持人🥰效力TVB超過35年今年劃上句號，冇特別歡送儀式，亦感謝各位同事齊齊做好節目灌輸更多生活常識比觀眾，多謝各位同我合作過嘅主持，能與你哋一齊工作很開心🥰」</p><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉與林淑敏合照。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767121310552064564280.jpeg/J_UwfxNlWAnE_ZfHX5-RBKocs97wOjpthYJ6WYWCelk\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉與林淑敏合照。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉與拍檔們合照。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767118902890496297345.jpeg/KMfM_zNZBxKuiOJ6O-BR16yicdBT8z3Eiap2x4mqdsc\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉與拍檔們合照。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉與拍檔們合照。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767116818190336912073.jpeg/9syAixcLG6XMTfKKGvWPGUs5p78wifaBcbyy2XG8stk\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉與拍檔們合照。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉與安德尊合照。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767114456666112490713.jpeg/x1tNbQ3YMKiGEaN0GeE-G4SwbYSBK2TLheIdwIXiHcA\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉與安德尊合照。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉與拍檔們合照。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767112111919104521906.jpeg/dSAkaamh0PdTObtez-9GWpzrY6FTpRiWpPsWEKT7FhA\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉與拍檔們合照。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>作為TVB午間婦女及資訊節目（如《都市閒情》、《流行都市》等）的代表人物之一，劉彩玉多年來陪伴不少觀眾度過午膳時間，形象深入民心。如今低調劃上句號，雖然她坦言「冇特別歡送儀式」，但字裏行間依然滿載對同事與觀眾的感謝。</p><p>消息流出後，不少觀眾與網民均感到可惜與不捨，紛紛留言感謝她多年來的付出與陪伴，並祝願她未來有更好的發展。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767326743236608564297.jpeg/m-cHZ1sWgrjFjIbVgpl8GMSz77Lc-Jpq-OVT1vjlU9Y\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767324432044032723461.jpeg/GWV3e1gdKSiyWd1el5wi-bGV1b_eLCGljxA6z48QOs8\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767322204737536291063.jpeg/SiUZDZVRkPNrUF5JFvIvOnDCO7Vz2pY3bHxq-Gx8avg\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194767319507668992490356.jpeg/GmtUB6pW63NhfEIT7rEbte1bwmVgDlNZhND_poTQ_6Y\"/><figcaption>劉彩玉在TVB人緣好好。（fb圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:05:43.707146+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":608,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:46:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:41.136848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:44.699036+00:00","content_hash":"b4c0ce0e86330137a3fc902f9b061784b80c19d94a8629208260352409dad768","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}